    "summary": "Support high-potential startups and strengthen venture ecosystems through EBRD’s Star Venture programme from Abidjan. The Associate delivers startup sourcing, business diagnostics, tailored advisory support and investor partnerships, helping founders improve investment readiness and scale their businesses across assigned Sub-Saharan African markets.",
